{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01169","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 · 乔知之","name":"相和歌辞 从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南庭结白露，北风埽黄叶。\n此时鸿燕来，惊鸣催思妾。\n曲房理鍼线，平碪捣文练。\n鸳绮裁易成，龙乡信难见。\n窈窕九重闺，寂寞十年啼。\n纱窗白云宿，罗幌月光栖。\n云月晓微微，愁思流黄机。\n玉霜冻珠履，金吹薄罗衣。\n汉家已得地，君去将何事？\n宛转结蚕书，寂寞无雁使。\n生平荷恩信，本爲容华进。\n况复落红颜，蝉声催绿鬓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}